Lemma uv_over : forall s E' x, uv (CC.env_over GT.NF s E') x = uv E' (CC.esubstL GT.NF s x).
Proof. ltac2:(Rpl.RP.run_i (rplG ()) 0 "S50!1,2|600;!1+10!3'lD'eE#3#2!2'bW2#1!3'lK'eE#3#1$s;R'k[$E';R+bU$x;R+bVvd!6'_913$b;R1!3+5+A!2'F0!2'bW!3'lD'eE#4#3#2!2'F0#1!2,O+A!2'F03!2'bW#24!4'lL'eE#3#2#1!3+5+A!2'b[2#1!2'b[#24").
